    "preamble": "Amrutlal Narsinhdas vs State Of Gujarat on 22 April, 2018 Author: B.N. Karia Bench: B.N. Karia R/Cr.Ra/466/2005 Order",
    "facts": "He stated that the original complainant Mr. N. P. Vyas has retired from service, and therefore, he is present on his behalf. Designated Officer, Surat Municipal Corporation has also issued a letter of authority in his favour to remain present stating that as the matter is placed in the Lok Adalat before this Court and if the applicant is ready and willing to deposit the amount of fine, let the matter be disposed of. In presence of learned advocate for the R/CR.RA/466/2005 ORDER Corporation, a zerox copy of the PAN card of the appellant- Amrutlal Narsinhdas Modi, who is also present before the Court, is taken on record.",
